  "summary": "Malicious code in grafeno-config (npm)",
  "details": "The preinstall hook of grafeno-config@1.0.0 downloads and executes a remote shell script from 216[.]126[.]236[.]46/x.sh via `curl -s... | sh`, then installs a crontab entry that re-runs the same download-and-execute every 30 minutes (after removing any prior crontab lines referencing 216.126). Installing the package therefore runs arbitrary remote code immediately and establishes persistent re-execution on the host.",
